##################################
# Composed game assets (launcher)
##################################
# `scripts/link-game-assets.ts` symlinks each selected sibling game's
# game-owned assets into `public/assets/` so the launcher can serve/build
# them. These are generated, never tracked (CG-0MUKYCG9L00587FA).
public/assets/games/*
public/assets/audio/beleaguered-castle
public/assets/audio/blackjack
public/assets/audio/coloretto
public/assets/audio/feudalism
public/assets/audio/golf
public/assets/audio/lost-cities
public/assets/audio/sushi-go
public/assets/cards/lost-cities
public/assets/sushi-go

##################################
# TypeScript
##################################
*.tsbuildinfo

